{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical Ops - Dead Zone is a multiplayer shooter where players must kill enemies to complete specific objectives. It's played from an isometric perspective and requires tactical and marksmanship skills to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creating a Room:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player can create a room, and other players can join these rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listing Room:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can list created rooms and enter any of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players start the game at their starting points in teams based on the selected game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895160/extras/215603419360716b82a214a834e32f08.poster.avif?t=1767272066\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895160/extras/215603419360716b82a214a834e32f08.webm?t=1767272066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895160/extras/215603419360716b82a214a834e32f08.mp4?t=1767272066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-Regional Conquest:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-To capture regions, players must go to areas with flags.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The team with the most players in the area captures the region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Capturing a region grants the right to teleport to that region after death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895160/extras/5b63f50d63b85f940ab3be7ad087cf62.poster.avif?t=1767272066\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895160/extras/5b63f50d63b85f940ab3be7ad087cf62.webm?t=1767272066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895160/extras/5b63f50d63b85f940ab3be7ad087cf62.mp4?t=1767272066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winning Conditions:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The game ends if one team captures all regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The team with the most regions captured by the timer wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-If the number of regions is equal by the timer, the match ends in a draw.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895160?t=1767272066","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895160?t=1767272066","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895160/933fba8d2910e13400582fbecf677592c1f6c220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767272066","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895160/933fba8d2910e13400582fbecf677592c1f6c220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767272066","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game uses various weapons to kill rival players. Blood effects appear on characters hit by bullets.\r\n\r\nThe game contains elements of war, conflict, and armed violence.\r\n\r\nThe game contains no sexual content."},"demos":[{"appid":3900020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical Ops - Dead Zone is a multiplayer shooter where players must kill enemies to complete specific objectives. It's played from an isometric perspective and requires tactical and marksmanship skills to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creating a Room:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player can create a room, and other players can join these rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listing Room:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can list created rooms and enter any of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players start the game at their starting points in teams based on the selected game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895160/extras/215603419360716b82a214a834e32f08.poster.avif?t=1767272066\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895160/extras/215603419360716b82a214a834e32f08.webm?t=1767272066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895160/extras/215603419360716b82a214a834e32f08.mp4?t=1767272066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-Regional Conquest:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-To capture regions, players must go to areas with flags.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The team with the most players in the area captures the region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Capturing a region grants the right to teleport to that region after death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895160/extras/5b63f50d63b85f940ab3be7ad087cf62.poster.avif?t=1767272066\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895160/extras/5b63f50d63b85f940a